# The application half is server-side source: the project's own PHP classes
# and Nino's optional modules with their install units - manifests, mail and
# page templates, text files. Nothing in here is ever requested by a browser;
# a module's browser-facing assets are read off disk and bundled into
# public/.cache/ like everything else (see \Nino\Modules\Assets).
Require all denied

Options -Indexes
